flowchart TD
  Key[Bearer API key] --> Hash[hash lookup api_keys]
  Hash --> Tenant[tenant_id derived server-side]
  Tenant --> Reject[Reject tenantId/customerId in client body]
  Tenant --> Web[tenant_web_targets allowlist]
  Tenant --> Azure[tenant_azure_scopes VERIFIED]
  Web --> Scans[(scans filtered by tenant_id)]
  Azure --> Scans
  Scans --> Results[(scan_results filtered by tenant_id)]
  Other[Other tenant API key] --> OtherTenant[other tenant_id]
  OtherTenant -. 404 .-> Scans